{
  "help_text": "Usage: kasumi <command> [options]\n\nCommands:\n  kasumi config                                Interactive profile wizard.\n  kasumi update                               Check and install the latest supported release.\n  kasumi sync <profile>                        Synchronize with remote storage.\n  kasumi sync <profile> --dry-run              Simulate without altering data.\n  kasumi status <profile>                      Show pending local changes.\n  kasumi fsck <profile>                        Audit remote integrity.\n  kasumi gc <profile>                          Remove orphaned objects.\n  kasumi gc purge-quarantine <profile> --confirm-permanent-loss\n                                               Permanently purge quarantine entries. WARNING: can permanently destroy reachable content.\n  kasumi gc repair-quarantine <profile> --confirm-permanent-loss\n                                               Clean up incomplete quarantine metadata whose payload is absent.\n  kasumi gc remove-writer <profile> <writer-id>\n                                               Remove one exact writer marker; verify its process is inactive.\n  kasumi resolve-missing <profile>             Resolve unavailable content as deleted.\n\nRemote inspection (read-only):\n  kasumi remote heads <profile>                Current logical heads.\n  kasumi remote tree <profile> [--head <id>]   Tree of a specific head.\n  kasumi remote commits <profile>              Reachable commits.\n  kasumi remote summary <profile>              General vault summary.\n  kasumi remote stat <profile> <path>          Properties of a specific path.\n  kasumi remote commit <profile> <id>          Commit details.\n  kasumi remote get <profile> <path> <dst>     Download authenticated file.\n  kasumi remote epochs <profile>               Epoch chain.\n  kasumi remote epoch <profile> <id>           Epoch details.\n  kasumi remote contents <profile>             Contents by metadata.\n  kasumi remote contents --audit <profile>     Cryptographic audit.\n  kasumi remote content <profile> <id>         Content details.\n  kasumi remote markers <profile>              Classify physical markers.\n  kasumi remote objects <profile>              Physical namespace.\n  kasumi remote orphans <profile>              List orphans; does not run GC.\n  kasumi remote quarantine <profile>           Quarantine state.\n  kasumi remote writers <profile>              Writers and barrier.\n  kasumi remote health <profile>               Full remote health diagnostic.\n\nGeneral options:\n  -h, --help, help                             Show this help message.\n  -v, --version, version                       Show Kasumi version.\n  --lang <en|pt-BR>                            Set language (English default).\n  --full                                       Display all items in sync plan.\n",
